---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import bookCover from '../../assets/misc/book-cover.jpg';
import bookFirstPage from '../../assets/misc/book-first-page.png';
import offsideThumb from '../../assets/misc/offside-dreams.jpg';
import talkThumb from '../../assets/misc/footprints-talk.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Miscellaneous — Shawn Han"
  description="A collection of side projects, films, writing, and archives from Shawn Han."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Miscellaneous</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-soft-ink">
      Some other fun things I've made, written, or gotten curious about along the way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 border-t border-white/10">
    <section class="py-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">
        Offside Dreams
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft-ink">
        Believe it or not, I've done quite a few humanities things and was a fairly artsy
        kid — or maybe I just love soccer so much that I wanted to explore every aspect of
        it. This is a short documentary I made in high school with my friends over the summer
        after junior year and the fall of senior year. It starts with getting to know an
        amateur women's soccer team that plays near my high school campus in Shanghai. We
        went on to talk with female youth players, women's league agents, and coaches to
        learn about the struggles of this overlooked sport. It was my first proper attempt to
        work with a camera and learn about the rich stories at the grassroots level of the
        sports I love.
      </p>

      <a
        href="https://youtu.be/blaeoIKQgNE"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group mt-6 block max-w-2xl overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-white/10"
        aria-label="Watch Offside Dreams on YouTube"
      >
        <div class="relative">
          <Image
            src={offsideThumb}
            alt="Still from Offside Dreams, a documentary about girls' football in Shanghai"
            widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 672px, 100vw"
            class="aspect-video w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
          />
          <span class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 via-black/0 to-black/0">
            <span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-black/65 text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105">
              <svg class="ml-0.5 h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5Z"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <a
          href="https://youtu.be/blaeoIKQgNE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink underline decoration-white/25 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent"
        >
          Watch on YouTube
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10 py-10">
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[150px_1fr]">
        <a
          href="/misc/from-colonials-to-collapse.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block w-28 sm:w-full"
          aria-label="Open From Colonials to Collapse PDF"
        >
          <Image
            src={bookCover}
            alt="Cover of From Colonials to Collapse: The Modern History of Chinese Football (1850–2025)"
            widths={[180, 300]}
            sizes="(min-width: 640px) 150px, 112px"
            class="w-full rounded-sm shadow-[0_18px_50px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]"
          />
        </a>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">
            From Colonials to Collapse
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-1 font-serif text-lg text-soft-ink">
            The Modern History of Chinese Football (1850–2025)
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft-ink">
            A long article that I wrote over most of high school — eventually a short book —
            about the arc of Chinese soccer: how the game arrived through colonial networks,
            became a stage for nation-building, and eventually collapsed under the weight of
            its own institutions. I was fortunate enough to present an excerpt of this
            research at SEC/AAS 2025.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://youtu.be/jtbqF4KgclY"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group mt-6 flex max-w-xl items-center gap-3"
      >
        <span class="relative block h-14 w-24 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-white/10">
          <Image
            src={talkThumb}
            alt=""
            width={192}
            height={108}
            class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]"
          />
          <span class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-black/25">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </span>
        <span class="min-w-0">
          <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-soft-ink">
            Talk · SEC/AAS 2025
          </span>
          <span class="mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
            Footprints of the Beautiful Game
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03]">
        <div class="grid gap-6 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] sm:p-5">
          <a
            href="/misc/from-colonials-to-collapse.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="block"
            aria-label="Open the first page of From Colonials to Collapse"
          >
            <Image
              src={bookFirstPage}
              alt="First page of From Colonials to Collapse"
              widths={[400, 600]}
              sizes="(min-width: 640px) 280px, 70vw"
              class="mx-auto max-h-[360px] w-auto rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-white shadow-[0_18px_50px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] sm:max-h-[420px]"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-soft-ink">Book preview</p>
            <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl text-ink">78 pages · 2025</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft-ink">
              The first page is shown here. Open the PDF for the full book, or expand the
              reader below without leaving the page.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
              <a
                href="/misc/from-colonials-to-collapse.pdf"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink underline decoration-white/25 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent"
              >
                Open PDF
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a
                href="/misc/from-colonials-to-collapse.html"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-soft-ink underline decoration-white/15 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
              >
                HTML edition
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <details class="group border-t border-white/10">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-soft-ink transition-colors hover:text-ink sm:px-5 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H20v16H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 21.5v-16Z"></path>
                <path d="M4 18.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 16H20"></path>
              </svg>
              Read in-page
            </span>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              PDF reader
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <iframe
            src="/misc/from-colonials-to-collapse.pdf#page=1&view=FitH"
            title="In-page reader for From Colonials to Collapse"
            class="h-[480px] w-full border-t border-white/10 bg-[#191919] sm:h-[620px]"
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10 py-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">
        Keeping the China files
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-soft-ink">
        While checking historical facts for that article, I found RSSSF — the Rec.Sport.Soccer
        Statistics Foundation — a soccer archive storing all kinds of match results and
        information. I found the work meaningful and interesting, so, like the other members,
        I became a maintainer of a section of the site and now upload results in my spare
        time. Start with the women's 2022 page. If you're interested in Chinese soccer, I'd
        recommend cfadata's specialized archive of Chinese soccer.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        <a
          href="https://www.rsssf.org/tablesc/chinawomen2022.html"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-soft-ink transition-colors hover:border-white/25 hover:text-ink"
        >
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
            <path d="M3 12h18"></path>
            <path d="M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9S14.5 18.4 12 21c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z"></path>
          </svg>
          RSSSF · China women 2022
          <svg class="h-3 w-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="http://www.cfadata.com/index.php"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-soft-ink transition-colors hover:border-white/25 hover:text-ink"
        >
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="4" rx="1"></rect>
            <path d="M5 8v11h14V8M9 12h6"></path>
          </svg>
          cfadata
          <svg class="h-3 w-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
